OL,3,GNEWSATributes pour in for popular DJ
OL,4,Aafter death age 34
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have poured in for a popular
OL,7,FBirmingham DJ who died at the age of
OL,8,F34.
OL,10,FEhi Oboite, known as DJ Buxley, was the
OL,11,Ffounder of Boxout Fest, an event which
OL,12,Fprovided a platform for the celebration
OL,13,Fof black music and culture and which
OL,14,Fattracted thousands of people to the
OL,15,Fcity.
OL,17,FHe died on Saturday after privately
OL,18,Fsuffering for four years from cancer.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
