OL,5,
OL,6,F"He made sure Birmingham had a strong
OL,7,Fcommunity of young people who were
OL,8,Fcharitable, helpful and knew how to
OL,9,Fhave a good ole time," said Shanequa
OL,10,FParis, Radio 1 and Newsround presenter.
